what the pile contained:

+4 gray dragon scale mail
+5 helm of telepathy
+3 gauntlets of power
+0 water walking boots
ring of conflict
wand of polymorph
magic marker

The guy had obviously choked to  death on a  corpse and the  only cursed items
were the gauntlets of power and the dragon scale mail (with +4 dragon mail who
cares!!!!)

Made the easiest start to a game I  have ever known.   BTW he died on level 48
due in part to a minotaur and my own stupidity :-)

